-up" class="h_link color-inversion-target w-inline-block"><div class="h_txt">REGISTER</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><section data-w-id="afedfe31-667c-c7b3-0247-375a5e7af9ae" class="hero_article"><div class="wrapper_article"><div class="article_box"><div><div class="tag_category"><div class="dot_dec black"></div><div class="tag_txt">Travel Tips</div></div></div><div class="article_headline_box"><h1 class="h1_article">Winter vacation destinations:  cold or warm — find your perfect destination with CHECK24</h1></div><div class="date_time"><div><div class="date_article">October 27, 2024</div></div><div class="read_time_box"><div class="read_time">3 min</div><div class="read_time">lesen</div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-w-id="cafe7420-bb79-1c7e-c1a0-8b5be32c0a9b" class="section_parallax"><div class="fullsize_image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f58728057fa44cf98b351_winter-vacation-destinations.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Winter vacation destinations:  cold or warm — find your perfect destination with CHECK24" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f58728057fa44cf98b351_winter-vacation-destinations-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f58728057fa44cf98b351_winter-vacation-destinations-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f58728057fa44cf98b351_winter-vacation-destinations.webp 1002w" class="image"/></div></section><section><div class="article_content"><div class="flex_article"><div class="voice_over"><a data-w-id="ddab0ff8-12df-a161-3538-2d6f1915d603" href="winter-travel-destinations-cold-or-warm#" class="voice_box w-inline-block"><div class="voice_first"><div class="voice_icon"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6713971095c4a7cab5d924ee/671d482bd7c1176b65d3fed6_listen.avif" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div><div class="listen_article start">Artikel anhören</div><div class="listen_article stop">Hör auf zu hören</div></div><div class="play_line"><div class="active_bar"></div><div class="passive_bar"></div></div></a></div><div class="content_article"><div class="description_box"><div class="description_first">Winter is a wonderful time to discover new vacation destinations. Whether you&#x27;re looking for snow-capped mountains, romantic Christmas markets, or sunny beaches, the world has something to offer for every taste. In this blog post, we&#x27;ll introduce you to the best winter vacation destinations that you can book through CHECK24. Get inspired and plan your next winter vacation!</div></div><div class="rich_part_1"><div class="w-richtext"><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img alt="Skiing in Zermatt with Matterhorn view" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f58adbea50a9f38d12289_zermatt-switzerland-winter.webp" loading="lazy"/></div></figure><h2><strong>1. Zermatt, Switzerland — A winter wonderland</strong></h2><p>Zermatt is the perfect place for winter sports enthusiasts and nature lovers. The impressive backdrop of the Matterhorn offers the ideal setting for skiing, snowboarding, and winter hiking.</p><h3><strong>Top hotels</strong></h3><ul role="list"><li><strong>Hotel Monte Rosa</strong> — Luxurious and historic.</li><li><strong>Zermatterhof</strong> — With a wellness area and gourmet restaurant.</li><li><strong>Schweizerhof </strong>— Located directly on the ski slopes.</li></ul><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><ol role="list"><li>Skiing on over 360 km of slopes.</li><li>Winter hiking with breathtaking views.</li><li>Visit the Matterhorn Museum.</li></ol><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img alt="Northern Lights over glass igloos in Lapland" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f58eb387686e06cf966f6_lapland-finland-northern-lights.webp" loading="lazy"/></div></figure><h2><strong>2. Lapland, Finland — Magical Northern Lights</strong></h2><p>For an unforgettable winter experience, Lapland in Finland is ideal. Here you can see the fascinating Northern Lights and spend the night in a glass igloo.</p><h3><strong>Top hotels</strong></h3><ul role="list"><li><strong>Kakslauttanen Arctic Resort</strong> — Famous for its glass igloos.</li><li><strong>Hotel Riekonlinna</strong> — Cozy rooms with tradition.</li><li><strong>Hotel Arctic TreeHouse</strong> — Modern tree houses with views of nature.</li></ul><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><ol role="list"><li>Dog sledding through untouched nature.</li><li>Visit Santa Claus Village in Rovaniemi.</li><li>Northern lights safaris under the starry sky.</li></ol><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img alt="Munich Christmas market at Marienplatz" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f593f4729d4a9fba3c7a8_munich-germany-christmas-market.webp" loading="lazy"/></div></figure><h2><strong>3. Munich, Germany — Festive Christmas markets</strong></h2><p>The Bavarian capital is particularly charming in winter. The traditional Christmas markets offer a festive atmosphere and delicious treats.</p><h3><strong>Top hotels</strong></h3><ul role="list"><li><strong>Bayerischer Hof</strong> — Elegant 5-star Hotel in the heart of Munich.</li><li><strong>Hotel Vier Jahreszeiten Kempinski </strong>— Luxurious and centrally located.</li><li><strong>NH München Deutscher Kaiser </strong>— Modern and comfortable.</li></ul><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><ol role="list"><li>Visit the famous Christkindlmarkt Christmas market on Marienplatz.</li><li>Go ice skating at Stachus.</li><li>Discover Munich&#x27;s museums and galleries.</li></ol><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img alt="Beach view in Tenerife during winter" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f5992664924b0a385d426_tenerife-spain-winter-sun.webp" loading="lazy"/></div></figure><h2><strong>4. Tenerife, Spain — Winter sun</strong></h2><p>If you want to escape the cold, Tenerife is the perfect choice. The island offers mild temperatures, beautiful beaches, and impressive natural surroundings.</p><h3><strong>Top hotels</strong></h3><ul role="list"><li><strong>Hotel Bahia del Duque</strong> — Luxury resort right on the beach.</li><li><strong>Iberostar Grand Hotel Mencey </strong>— Elegant design with wellness area.</li><li><strong>Hotel Riu Palace Tenerife </strong>— All-inclusive resort with numerous amenities.</li></ul><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><ol role="list"><li>Hiking in Teide National Park.</li><li>Relaxing on the beaches of Costa Adeje.</li><li>Exploring the charming old town of La Laguna.</li></ol><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img alt="Ski resort in Aspen with snowy mountains" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f5a08f02d084a2729e690_aspen-usa-ski-resort.webp" loading="lazy"/></div></figure><h2><strong>5. Aspen, USA — Skiing in style</strong></h2><p>Aspen is the perfect destination for discerning winter sports enthusiasts. Here you will find first-class ski resorts, luxurious accommodation, and a lively après-ski scene.</p><h3><strong>Top hotels</strong></h3><ul role="list"><li><strong>The Little Nell </strong>— Right on the slopes with excellent service.</li><li><strong>Hotel Jerome </strong>— Historic and stylish.</li><li><strong>St. Regis Aspen Resort </strong>— Luxurious with a fantastic spa.</li></ul><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><ol role="list"><li>Skiing and snowboarding on the best slopes.</li><li>Enjoy the nightlife in Aspen.</li><li>Relax in one of the first-class spas.</li></ol><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img alt="Skiing and snowboarding in Whistler" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f5a6dcaf85663bfc26a87_whistler-canada-skiing.webp" loading="lazy"/></div></figure><h2><strong>6. Whistler, Canada — Adventure in the snow</strong></h2><p>Whistler is one of North America&#x27;s best ski resorts. The impressive mountains offer excellent opportunities for winter sports enthusiasts and adventure seekers.</p><h3><strong>Top hotels</strong></h3><ul role="list"><li><strong>Fairmont Chateau Whistler</strong> — Luxurious with direct access to the slopes.</li><li><strong>Pan Pacific Whistler Village Center </strong>— Comfortable suites in the heart of the village.</li><li><strong>Four Seasons Resort Whistler</strong> — Elegant and relaxing.</li></ul><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><ol role="list"><li>Skiing and snowboarding in one of the largest ski areas.</li><li>Snowshoeing and winter bike tours.</li><li>Visit the numerous restaurants and bars in Whistler Village.</li></ol><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img alt="Skiers on the Sölden glacier" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f5a9ba6b96d00ed0d2615_soelden-austria-glacier.webp" loading="lazy"/></div></figure><h2><strong>7. Sölden, Austria — For ski enthusiasts</strong></h2><p>Sölden is a popular destination for skiers looking for world-class slopes and exciting nightlife.</p><h3><strong>Top hotels</strong></h3><ul role="list"><li><strong>Alpenhotel Laurin</strong> — Cozy hotel with spa area.</li><li><strong>Hotel Jagdhof </strong>— Luxurious with excellent service.</li><li><strong>Die Berge Lifestyle-Hotel</strong> — Modern and stylish.</li></ul><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><ol role="list"><li>Skiing on the glacier.</li><li>Après-ski in the famous bars and clubs.</li><li>Visit the Ötztal Heritage and Open-Air Museum.</li></ol><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img alt="Winter lights at Rockefeller Center NYC" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f5af037bd1626bd2fd208_new-york-city-winter.webp" loading="lazy"/></div></figure><h2><strong>8. New York City, USA — Winter Wonderland</strong></h2><p>In winter, New York City transforms into an enchanting winter wonderland with festive lights and numerous activities.</p><h3><strong>Top Hotels</strong></h3><ul role="list"><li><strong>The Standard High Line </strong>— Modern with breathtaking views.</li><li><strong>The NoMad Hotel </strong>— Elegant and centrally located.</li><li><strong>The Ritz-Carlton New York, Central Park</strong> — Luxurious with views of Central Park.</li></ul><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><ol role="list"><li>Ice skating at Rockefeller Center.</li><li>Visit the impressive Christmas decorations around the city.</li><li>Explore the best museums, such as MoMA and the Metropolitan Museum of Art.</li></ol><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img alt="Après-ski in Ischgl with snow views" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f5b27dcdf71f909b9104f_ischgl-austria-apres-ski.webp" loading="lazy"/></div></figure><h2><strong>9. Ischgl, Austria — Après-ski stronghold</strong></h2><p>Ischgl is known for its excellent ski slopes and legendary après-ski. Unforgettable experiences in the snow await you here.</p><h3><strong>Top hotels</strong></h3><ul role="list"><li><strong>Schlosshotel Ischgl </strong>— Luxurious with a large wellness area.</li><li><strong>Hotel Post </strong>— Traditional with a modern flair.</li><li><strong>Alpenhotel Ischgl</strong> — Cozy and comfortable.</li></ul><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><ol role="list"><li>Skiing in one of Europe&#x27;s best ski resorts.</li><li>Experience legendary après-ski in the bars and clubs.</li><li>Enjoy local specialties in the restaurants.</li></ol><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img alt="Tropical beach in Koh Samui during winter" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f5b5f9e2a349a1f1d0130_koh-samui-thailand-winter.webp" loading="lazy"/></div></figure><h2><strong>10. Koh Samui, Thailand — Winter paradise in the sun</strong></h2><p>If you&#x27;re looking for a break from the cold, Koh Samui is the perfect destination. Here you&#x27;ll find beautiful beaches and tropical weather.</p><h3><strong>Top hotels</strong></h3><ul role="list"><li><strong>The Ritz-Carlton, Ko Samui</strong> — Luxurious with breathtaking sea views.</li><li><strong>Four Seasons Resort Ko Samui </strong>— Exclusive and relaxing.</li><li><strong>SALA Samui Chaweng Beach Resort </strong>— Modern and stylish.</li></ul><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><ol role="list"><li>Relax on the beautiful beaches.</li><li>Visit the famous Big Buddha.</li><li>Explore Ang Thong National Marine Park.</li></ol></div></div><div class="rich_part_2"><div class="w-richtext"><h2><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2><p>Whether you&#x27;re looking for cold or warm weather, the world offers numerous winter vacation destinations that can be booked through CHECK24. From snow-covered mountains to sunny beaches – discover your perfect winter destination and experience unforgettable moments!</p><p>‍</p></div></div><div class="rich_part_3 w-condition-invisible"><div class="w-dyn-bind-empty w-richtext"></div></div><div class="rich_part_4 w-condition-invisible"><div class="w-dyn-bind-empty w-richtext"></div></div></div><div class="socials_share"><div class="social_flex"><a fs-socialshare-element="facebook" href="winter-travel-destinations-cold-or-warm#" class="social_icon w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6713971095c4a7cab5d924ee/671d47b7b2fc27917fea3991_facebook.avif" loading="lazy" alt="Face